	(text "BATTERY CONNECTOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
				(thickness 0.6096)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b290522-3710-4bfe-bc5a-834d20efccec")
	)
	(text "USB-C (phone): phone is the USB host. CC1/CC2 go to the STM32 UCPD (PB6/PB4): Rd by default,\nPD power-role swap lets the robot charge the phone while it stays host. Q27 blocks the phone's\nVBUS from back-feeding the robot 5 V (the TMI6240 body diode conducts VOUT->VIN); PWR_EN turns\non TMI6240 and Q27 together. TMI6240 now runs from VSENS-5V-USB (U25 buck removed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 179.07 34.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "31e8f042-5a87-4f6b-86db-ed454a245453")
	)
	(text "configured as 4S"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "70a2dc89-1956-4225-8d69-3214058e4329")
	)
	(text "BATTERY CHARGER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 184.15 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
				(thickness 0.6096)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7c0edb60-bd92-48fd-8e9e-024b6e1bf152")
	)
	(text "DC_IN: 20 V brick or dock. With the battery disconnected (Q14 off) VBAT-14V4 = DC_IN - 0.4 V,\nso the SLM6900 (95% max duty) needs >= ~18.5 V to finish a 4S charge. Keep DC_IN <= 22 V (D41, Q13 Vgs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.546 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8494b442-f1ad-41c3-9a09-dc5873f8ea93")
	)
	(text "2.2 - 2.6 Amp"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 210.566 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a1179408-1fcf-408a-a9e5-977a37fd7d53")
	)
	(text "VBUS lockout: the robot 5 V (TMI6240 + Q27) can only\nturn on while VBUS is ~0 V. Q33 holds PWR_EN_G low if a\nphone already sources VBUS; once on, Q34 latches it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.28 64.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a7ddd8fb-973e-488c-81fe-76ad309b1897")
	)
	(text "Rail-hold: charger power (dock or barrel jack)\nturns the MCU rail on and keeps it on.\nDC_IN to GND ~130k (R175+R194 || R199+R200)\n= dock presence signature."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 176.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd738412-9117-408a-a98e-e78b2e3b8eb1")
	)
	(text "USB-C"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 27.94 0)
		(effects
